<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 3 Best in Slot Gear list for Resto Druids in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Trial of the Grand Crusader and Ulduar. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 3</h2>Phase 3 is a paradigm shift in how tier drops work and how a raid achieves the highest ilvl gear. As a healer, it's recommended to preserve the heroic tier tokens and ilvl 272 cloaks for the dps in your raid as this will typically have a higher impact on raid quality. Outside of the top end of guilds, this doesn't necessarily hold true and you might have a better understanding of your personal raid situation.<br/>
<br/>As such, there will be two recommended sets: Pure BiS and Realistic BiS. Pure BiS will be the highly contested drops, and Realistic BiS will be what a typical healer could expect to complete by the end of the phase.<br/>
<br/>For both, you will want to achieve your 4 piece T9 set bonus: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67128/item-druid-t9-restoration-4p-bonus-rejuvenation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Item - Druid T9 Restoration 4P Bonus (Rejuvenation)</span></a>. This is a very strong set bonus equivalent to around 200 to 300 spell power depending on your personal gear situation and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=48441/rejuvenation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_rejuvenation.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rejuvenation</span></a> usage.<br/>
<br/>The impact of critical strike rating as a stat is still low even with this set bonus, so it is not recommended to gear heavily towards crit. The best returns will be found by continuing to gear with a spell power and haste rating focus and leveraging your existing crit chance.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="when-to-swap-out-t8-gear">When to Swap out T8 Gear?</h4>Only break 4pc T8 once you have 4pc T9, four non-set BiS pieces, or a combination of the two.<br/>
<br/>Ulduar non-set BiS is very close in value to T8 4pc, so if you have any of those BiS non-set pieces, you can swap as soon as you have four strong gear swaps to replace all your T8 pieces at once.<br/>
<br/>Phase 3 BiS is still 4pc T9, and non-set gear should be swapped out once you have four pieces of T9.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="gems-in-phase-3">Gems in Phase 3</h4>Epic orange and purple gems now round up on spell power, as opposed to rare gems in previous phases that rounded down. Along with increased value to haste rating as spell power totals increase, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40155/reckless-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ametrine</span></a> becomes BiS over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40113/runed-cardinal-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Cardinal Ruby</span></a> until you reach haste cap (735 or 856 depending on if you take <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=16924/celestial-focus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_starfire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Celestial Focus</span></a>).<br/>
<br/>Gem <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40155/reckless-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ametrine</span></a> to haste cap. Once haste capped, fill with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40113/runed-cardinal-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Cardinal Ruby</span></a>. Always socket <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40133/purified-dreadstone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Purified Dreadstone</span></a> on a socket bonus of +9 spell power. Socketing <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40133/purified-dreadstone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Purified Dreadstone</span></a> on a +7 spell power socket bonus is similar to -2 spell power and +4 mp5.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Disclaimer: Only heroic mode drops are being considered from ToGC loot. If you are doing normal modes, the same items should be prioritized in the same orders listed below.</b>
