<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Triumph for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 3</h3>
<a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> will drop in ToGC 10M/<wbr/>25M, VoA 10M/<wbr/>25M, as well as Titan Rune Beta daily dungeons. <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> should be pooled to buy ilvl 245 T9 pieces in combination with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a>. If you want to gamble on upgrading straight to heroic tier tokens, you can choose to spend your <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> on the intermediate upgrades lower in the list.<br/>
<br/>After ilvl 245 tier tokens, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47671/idol-of-flaring-growth">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_relics_idolofrejuvenation.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of Flaring Growth</span></a> is the most important use of <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a>. Swapping out <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40342/idol-of-awakening">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thegoldencheep.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of Awakening</span></a> is one of the last swaps you should make when prioritizing throughput over regen as it is comparable mp5 to using two regen trinkets. The swap is understandable once a good number of Phase 3 pieces are acquired to float the easy regen needs of an "only bosses" phase.<br/>
<br/>Avoid  spending <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> on the ilvl 232 tier pieces, as this only serves to delay you from purchasing your ilvl 245 tier pieces when your trophies are collected.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47556/crusader-orb">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_rune.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crusader Orb</span></a> is included for its use in intermediary crafted options or to sell for gold once you've acquired all your tier pieces.<br/>
