<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 3</h3>The ilvl 272 cloaks will the most highly contested drops in Phase 3. Requiring zero wipes in an entire 25M heroic raid for them to drop, they will be both rare and coveted.<br/>
<br/> Aiming for the ilvl 258 cloaks from either 25M Icehowl or a zero wipe 10M run is a more achievable back option. They have identical stats, so if you get more advantage in your loot system by taking the 10M version, that would be preferable.<br/>
<br/>Runner-up behind these options is the 25M Algalon quest cloak, then the normal mode versions all the ToGC cloaks below.<br/>
