<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 3</h3>Heroic T9 Boomkin chest is technically the best chest option in Phase 3. Getting prioritized a 5th piece of heroic tier (for your offspec) in most circumstances is very difficult to achieve. If you feel it's unrealistic, the Ascent chest is your best option. The Shattered Fellowship chest is a very close runner-up if you do not want to compete with any other cloth wearers.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Do not buy ilvl 245 T9 Boomkin chest with trophy+badges for your resto set. It is worse than all the options listed.</b>
