<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 3</h3>T9 legs are the best option. The stat increases from other options do not outweigh the T9 4 piece set bonus. Soothing Touch legs are a slight upgrade in throughput and regen stats to T9 legs. The Awakening legs are higher throughput, but are missing a lot of regen. They are a good option if you're looking for legs you can use for resto and boomkin sets.<br/>
