<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 3</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47059/solace-of-the-defeated">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_dungeon_ulduar77_25man.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Solace of the Defeated</span></a>/<wbr/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47432/solace-of-the-fallen">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_dungeon_ulduar77_25man.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Solace of the Fallen</span></a> &amp; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45535/show-of-faith">
