<br/>Trinkets and Idols are the slots that should be swapped around to adjust to throughput and regen needs in raid.<br/>
<br/>If you feel mana is comfortable, consider swapping out <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40342/idol-of-awakening">
